# Runtime-generated workspace files
**/workspace-layout.generated.conf
**/workspaces.generated.jsonc

# Optional logs / temp files
*.log


# Stow conflict backups (never commit — real files live without this suffix)
**/*.before-stow
**/*.before-stow.*

# Git merge-conflict-marker debris (when a bad resolution turns the marker
# line into a filename — never commit these)
**/*~Updated upstream
**/*~Stashed changes
**/*~HEAD

# Claude files
**/claude_notes/**

# Monitor live files
**/monitors.conf